      "decision": "Preserve love as practiced allegiance rather than sentimentality.",
      "disposition": "APPROVE_QA"
    },
    {
      "location": "14:33-40",
      "decision": "Retain the difficult textual and social questions around women's speech, with the wider letter's evidence of women praying and prophesying kept visible.",
      "disposition": "APPROVE_QA"
    },
    {
      "location": "15:1-58",
      "decision": "Preserve bodily resurrection, Adam/Christ typology, and the mystery language without speculative expansion.",
